Z||000001||kslish||07-11-2001||06:40 PM||||Is the car setting any codes?  How many miles are on that car (I forgot to look) and does it still have the original catalytic converter?  The converter could be toast.....  A new oxygen sensor couldn't hurt either, but only put in a genuine AC/Delco or Bosch one.<P>Or the cheapest possible trick, dump a bottle of quality name brand fuel system cleaner in a full tank of fuel and see if that clears up the problem (probably not, but might help a little)<BR><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
